*Correct.*  The algebraic manipulation is sound; equality forces each line to attain the bound and forces the point‑sets to be disjoint.

---

### 9.  Identifying the lines that attain the bound  

> “Equation (2.1) with \(|p+q|=2\) gives three possibilities:  
