---

### 11.  Conclusion  

> “The only non‑negative integers \(k\) … are \(\boxed{\;k\in\{0,1,3\}\;}\) for every integer \(n\ge3\).”

*Correct.*  The final answer matches the constructions and the impossibility arguments.

